NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Cardiff and across South Wales. Whether you're a new business launching in the capital or an established company refreshing your brand, we design logos that work across every touchpoint.

If you are searching for a logo designer in Cardiff, the goal is usually simple: you need a brand that looks credible on your website, social media, signage, workwear, quotes, invoices, and printed materials. We design logos with those real uses in mind from the start.

## Standing out in Cardiff

Cardiff is a competitive market. Whether you're a tradesperson, a retailer, a professional services firm, or a hospitality business, a strong logo is what separates a business that looks the part from one that doesn't. It's the foundation of your marketing — your website, your social media, your signage, your uniforms.

A professionally designed logo signals credibility before a customer has read a single word about what you do.

## Logo design for Cardiff start-ups and small businesses

Your logo needs to work in a busy local market. Cardiff customers compare businesses quickly, especially on Google, social media, and mobile. A professional logo helps your business look established, even if you are just starting out.

We help Cardiff businesses with:

- New company logo design
- Logo refreshes for established businesses
- Brand colours and font choices
- Social media profile graphics
- Website-ready logo files
- Print-ready logo files for signage, uniforms, and stationery

## What's included

Every Cardiff logo design project includes:

- 5 initial logo concepts — distinct directions to choose from
- Revisions until you're completely happy with the result
- Brand colour palette and typography choices
