## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Get in touch for a quote — we offer transparent fixed-price packages with no hidden extras. The cost depends on whether you need logo design only, brand guidelines, social media assets, or a full website and brand package.

**How long does it take?**

Most projects are completed within 5–10 working days depending on feedback turnaround.

**Will I own the logo?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files is transferred to you on completion.

**Can you design my Cardiff business's website too?**

Yes — we offer [web design](/services/web-design/) and [web development](/services/web-development/) services alongside logo design.

**Do you create logos for Cardiff trades and local service businesses?**

Yes. We design logos for trades, professional services, hospitality, retail, ecommerce, and local service businesses across Cardiff and South Wales.

**Will the logo files work for signs, vans, websites, and social media?**

Yes. You receive web and print formats, including vector files for signage and large-format use.

